{
  "description": "D26 amendment (Things-style capture view, prototype, after Things' Quick Entry): the title with a leading glyph and the URL under it, backlinks as two-line rows whose focused row is a grey pill (not the accent), and a footer on the grouped surface with the context bottom left and Cancel then Copy link (the accent) as capsules bottom right; without and with backlinks, light and dark; screenshots recorded",
  "requirement": "D26",
  "notes": [
    "view.layout (views/layout.rs, automation builds), window points, each {x, y, w, h, right, bottom}: footer = the footer bar under its hairline, cancel_button / copy_button = the two buttons, footer_fill = a 24 pt square at the right end of the footer's context (empty grouped surface), selected_fill = a 24 pt square inside the focused backlink row's pill, 8 pt in from its top and right edges; backlinks_box and last_backlink as in capture-fit.",
    "Expected colours are written here, not read from design/: the footer is color.underPageBackground (#f6f6f6 / #282828); the focused row is rowSelected over the card (#ebebeb / #393939), far from rc.5's accent fill; Copy link is the primary fill #0072ef (blue fixture); the body is the card.",
    "Exits 1 on 5ce08a9 (rc.5) at \"the footer: context, Cancel, Copy link\" (no Cancel button).",
    "Pixel and screenshot steps need Screen Recording: ENV-BLOCKED without it."
  ],
  "setup": {
    "graph": "graph-backlinks.json",
    "fixtures": {
      "capture": "capture-ok.json",
      "permission": "permissions-all-granted.json",
      "accent": "accent-blue.json"
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "capture (no backlinks)",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "capture"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "capture"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "captured: title and URL",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Example Domain"
        },
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "https://example.com/"
        }
      ],
      "route": "capture",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "the footer: context, Cancel, Copy link",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "Label",
          "text": "Capture",
          "exact": true
        },
        {
          "role": "Button",
          "text": "Cancel"
        },
        {
          "role": "Button",
          "text": "Copy link"
        }
      ],
      "route": "capture"
    },
    {
      "name": "no backlink rows",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem"
      },
      "absent": true,
      "route": "capture",
      "timeout_ms": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "light: set_appearance",
      "call": "set_appearance",
      "args": {
        "mode": "light"
      },
      "expect": {
        "theme": "light"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "state",
      "retry_ms": 2000,
      "expect": {
        "route": "capture",
        "appearance.theme": "light"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "plain/light: Copy link is inside the footer (top)",
      "call": "state",
      "retry_ms": 2000,
      "expect": {
        "view.layout.copy_button.y": {
          "ge": {
            "path": "view.layout.footer.y"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "plain/light: Copy link is inside the footer (bottom)",
      "call": "state",
      "retry_ms": 2000,
      "expect": {
        "view.layout.copy_button.bottom": {
          "le": {
            "path": "view.layout.footer.bottom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "plain/light: Copy link is inside the footer (right)",
      "call": "state",
      "retry_ms": 2000,
      "expect": {
        "view.layout.copy_button.right": {
          "le": {
            "path": "view.layout.footer.right"
          }
        }
